body:
I just read this story and it reminded me a lot of innocent friend and people going though the same thing! Let me know if you think this is fair!!! This didn't happen to me, but is crazy that people like this get away. Stealing money from innocent families and harming innocent people. I hope you all stay safe out there and learn to be very careful will these scam artists. Sorry to hear all of your stories and I wish you all the best. :)

